  "implementation": [
    "Pure lazy lunar-calendar shared with original lunar UI; no duplicate converter or new dependency. Lunar month strings already include the leap prefix, so remove the duplicated prefix.",
    "Strict civil and lunar validation; input conversion preserves the original solar ISO time and offset, precision and reminder flag. Invalid input cannot save; switching valid calendars preserves the same date.",
    "Missing leap month uses same ordinary month; absent day uses month end only for annual recurrence, never for typed input. Missing/failed conversion cannot silently use solar anniversary.",
    "Widget and automation source share current lunar year mapping and age; January before Lunar New Year uses the preceding lunar year. Solar midnight and Feb29-to-Mar1 behavior retained.",
    "Owned Preact editor, bounded modal body and persistent footer, 32/44 px targets, nested background disposal and DOM-owned dialog closure when cached board hides. Settings-page disposal also closes owned anniversary editors."
  ],
